# Nine-slice frame, 4px border: carved stone.
#
# Bright top edge, dark bottom edge, so a frame stretched to any size still
# reads as lit from above — the corners carry the light, and the corners are
# the part a nine-slice never scales.
name platformer-ui-frame
size 16 16
key o outline
key M stone-2-hilite
key S stone-1
key m stone-0-shadow
key s dusk-0-far
pixels
oooooooooooooooo
oMMMMMMMMMMMMMMo
oMSSSSSSSSSSSSMo
oMSmmmmmmmmmmSMo
*8 oMSmssssssssmSMo
oMSmmmmmmmmmmSMo
oMSSSSSSSSSSSSMo
oSSSSSSSSSSSSSSo
oooooooooooooooo
